From: Harvi654 <202698022+Harvi654@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] ntdll: Report the token's integrity level.

AI-assisted (Claude), original code; LGPL-2.1-or-later. Not submitted upstream.

NtQueryInformationToken(TokenIntegrityLevel) returned a constant
S-1-16-12288 (High) for every token. Windows 10 returns Medium for the
limited token of a normal process and High for an elevated one, with the
attributes SE_GROUP_INTEGRITY | SE_GROUP_INTEGRITY_ENABLED. Ask the
server for the token's level (previous patch) and build the label SID
from it. The size and layout of the returned TOKEN_MANDATORY_LABEL do not
change; the WoW64 thunk already converts it.

Needs server-token-integrity-level.patch (the get_token_info reply field).

v1 2026-11-24: first version.

diff --git a/dlls/ntdll/unix/security.c b/dlls/ntdll/unix/security.c
--- a/dlls/ntdll/unix/security.c
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/unix/security.c
@@ -606,18 +606,25 @@ NTSTATUS WINAPI NtQueryInformationToken( HANDLE token, TOKEN_INFORMATION_CLASS c
         break;
 
     case TokenIntegrityLevel:
+        SERVER_START_REQ( get_token_info )
         {
-            /* report always "S-1-16-12288" (high mandatory level) for now */
-            static const SID high_level = {SID_REVISION, 1, {SECURITY_MANDATORY_LABEL_AUTHORITY},
-                                                            {SECURITY_MANDATORY_HIGH_RID}};
-
+            static const SID_IDENTIFIER_AUTHORITY label_authority = {SECURITY_MANDATORY_LABEL_AUTHORITY};
             TOKEN_MANDATORY_LABEL *tml = info;
-            PSID psid = tml + 1;
+            SID *sid = (SID *)(tml + 1);
 
-            tml->Label.Sid = psid;
-            tml->Label.Attributes = SE_GROUP_INTEGRITY | SE_GROUP_INTEGRITY_ENABLED;
-            memcpy( psid, &high_level, sizeof(SID) );
+            req->handle = wine_server_obj_handle( token );
+            status = wine_server_call( req );
+            if (!status)
+            {
+                sid->Revision = SID_REVISION;
+                sid->SubAuthorityCount = 1;
+                sid->IdentifierAuthority = label_authority;
+                sid->SubAuthority[0] = reply->integrity_level;
+                tml->Label.Sid = sid;
+                tml->Label.Attributes = SE_GROUP_INTEGRITY | SE_GROUP_INTEGRITY_ENABLED;
+            }
         }
+        SERVER_END_REQ;
         break;
 
     case TokenUIAccess:
